DIR
FORMAT TESTDISK
VOL
DIR
ECHO first line > NOTES.TXT
ECHO second line >> NOTES.TXT
TYPE NOTES.TXT
COPY NOTES.TXT COPY.TXT
MD DOCS
MD DOCS
COPY *.TXT DOCS
CD DOCS
DIR
CD..
REN COPY.TXT NOTES.TXT
REN COPY.TXT OTHER.TXT
DIR /W
TYPE NOPE.TXT
RD DOCS
DEL DOCS\*.TXT
RD DOCS
CD \DOCS
MD NOWHERE\SUB
MD TOOLONGNAME.TXT
COPY CON POEM.TXT
roses are red
violets are blue

TYPE POEM.TXT
DEL *.TXT
DIR
DEL
BOGUS
VER
EXIT
